ries":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CtXv5uzc7L5yTkhjA5lJKA","review_id":"lPD2kBYC4vjlIw-4pwjxhg","date":"2021-02-20T17:26:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9239241480827332,"text_excerpt":"Lovingly referred to as the \"Blue Store,\" the Seafood Store on N Broad is a New Orleans gem. This was my first time getting crawfish from them, and they did not disappoint. I ordered 3lbs of crawfish with sausage and potatoes. The crawfish was well seasoned with a spicy kick. And the staff was very friendly and helpful when I was deciding what to order."},{"business_id":"CtXv5uzc7L5yTkhjA5lJKA","review_id":"HXF2wM3wq28nLItIGO7blw","date":"2017-03-27T19:56:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9137390851974487,"text_excerpt":"I came in here on my last day in New Orleans. A girl at Triangle Deli told me this was the best spot to get crawfish. She was friendly and looked like she recognized my madness, my hunt for the best crawfish. I was staying in the Gentilly area and actual drove past this little slice of heaven while on my E2 bus ride from the airport. I got in around 12:50pm and when it was my turn this cute Vietnamese looking guy told me there was no crawfish, but some would be coming out at 1pm. He advised me to grab a cardboard box to house my soon to be 5 pounds of crawfish (for $20!!!!!!!) and protect my lap from the juices that would be running down my thighs (too crude??) but seriously ladies and ge..."},{"business_id":"CtXv5uzc7L5yTkhjA5lJKA","review_id":"N6uocph6AfTgxQjmpFft2w","date":"2021-07-06T18:13:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9091702103614807,"text_excerpt":"This spot has it all. It has pretty good crawfish when its in season, good poboys, etc. It is also one of the most acclaimed spots for turkey necks, if that's your jam. But this review isn't about those things. This review is about the FRIED RICE. North Broad Seafood has the best fried rice in the city. My boyfriend and I frequently go out of our way for this fried rice. Do yourself a favor and try it out for yourself."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CtXv5uzc7L5yTkhjA5lJKA","photo_id":"sf5nGBjZSb8Po3LPoMWJsQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sf5nGBjZSb8Po3LPoMWJsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
